<p>At its July meeting, the Mandan City Commission granted the Bismarck-Mandan Musicians Association and Art in the Park Committee permission to construct a $20,000 brick stage at the west end of BN Park, now Dykshoorn Park. The groups planned to raise private funds for the band shell. In October 2015, it was named the Vern Cermak Band Shell in recognition of {% person "vern-cermak" %}Vern Cermak's{% endperson %} lifetime contributions. He helped organize Buggies-n-Blues for 22 years and assisted with many other activities and events in the park.</p>

